{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGFyYW5vaWQtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNi0lMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Paranoid","description":"The murder of a young mother on a playground propels the investigating detectives down a path of discovery that tests their personal lives and safety. As the investigation unfolds, the scope of involvement widens to a conspiracy far outside the bounds of their community.\n\nRated 15 · Ended · First aired 22 Sept 2016 · United Kingdom · Language: English · 45 min\nStudio: Red Production Company · Network: ITV1\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Mystery","Crime","Drama","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGFyYW5vaWQtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNi0lMjktNzIwcC8.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2016-09-22T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"When local GP Angela Benton is murdered in a children’s playground, detectives Bobby Day, Nina Suresh and Alec Wayfield embark on what appears to be a straightforward murder investigation. However, it soon becomes apparent that Angela’s death has more to it than meets the eye.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tlciRsLhOF0PCTeAUsazPygqXCA.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGFyYW5vaWQtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNi0lMjktNzIwcC8.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2016-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As pressure mounts to wrap up the case, the detectives uncover clues of their own that point to the murder being more than just a random attack.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nJHKVrVQjhA3abkaxesfXZp7159.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGFyYW5vaWQtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNi0lMjktNzIwcC8.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2016-10-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Alec is rescued from the water and has an unexpected visitor in hospital… Meanwhile, in Dusseldorf, Linda has a breakthrough and she starts to believe that Ruben Locana’s death wasn’t an accident. And it’s a race against time as Bobby, Nina and Alec try to locate the mystery pages at the heart of the case.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kBG3HaJ50ODE2iGdBNtZ1nCsTxy.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGFyYW5vaWQtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNi0lMjktNzIwcC8.1.4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2016-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Bobby arrives in Dusseldorf to uncover the mystery surrounding Ruben Locana's death. Chasing a lead turns out to have catastrophic consequences for one of the detectives on the case.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dYYF6AuuPSDaRRWfkZXuUHOCJvv.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGFyYW5vaWQtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNi0lMjktNzIwcC8.1.5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2016-10-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Now that the Ghost Detective has been unmasked, Alec and Nina trade favours for information, but fail to consider the deadly repercussions of their actions. Bobby and Linda come up against a cunning adversary in Dusseldorf, and a surprise ambush leads to a breakthrough in the case - but leaves lives hanging in the balance.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Hg8HtRx2ujKosY2aQYu3QcH8d2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGFyYW5vaWQtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNi0lMjktNzIwcC8.1.6","title":"Episode 6","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2016-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Lucy reveals a secret past which devastates Bobby, while police in Germany and the UK make a breakthrough involving drug trials.","thumbnail":"https://